{"id":"vod_sn_36565","vodId":"36565","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"DOG DAYS第一季","name_cn":"DOG DAYS第一季","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/a627268c369dba50a9302f38e4859995.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一个名为“弗洛尼尔德”的架空世界之中，迦雷特狮子团的公主蕾昂米修莉（小清水亚美 配音）带领着她的精锐部队大举入侵邻国比斯科迪共和国，身为共和国的公主，米希奥蕾（堀江由衣 配音）深深的为祖国的未来担忧着，无奈之下，她决心向异世界发出求救的信号，希望那里有人能够成为国家的救星。　　泉真红（宫野真守 配音）只是一介平凡的日本少年，然而，正是他受到了米希奥蕾的召唤，来到了弗洛尼尔德，在这里，他结识了个性认真的艾克蕾尔（竹达彩奈 配音）、聪慧过人的利歌塔（水树奈奈 配音）和成熟稳重的尤基卡泽（阿澄佳奈 配音）等人，在和蕾昂米修莉的战斗中，泉真红和伙伴们的羁绊也在加深着。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:44:15","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YxDYMj6JQP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UexbyW6TJ31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BcU9WwGbsP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pEyfG2gekC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7yFQjvriCH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/N3KKs8kytA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wReYHJ1WgR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/M0CDYyQs251/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xESQdCEmB21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TrZ9D72Qj91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5Bj6zMWphy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RfgTSvZbN61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Y8bARQRtbh1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:21.176Z"}